  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen syftar till att m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;ra studiebes&#xf6;k till Sverige f&#xf6;r ukrainska masterstudenter i ekonomi, genom Stockholm Institute of Transition Economics (SITE). Genom en parallell insats (76003753) st&#xf6;ds &#xe4;ven mastersprogrammet som studenterna tillh&#xf6;r av Sida. Mastersprogrammet genomf&#xf6;rs av Economic Education and Research Consortium (EERC)i Ukraina.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this contribution is to support study visits to Sweden for Ukrainian master students in economics, through the Stockholm Institute of Transition Economics (SITE). Through a parallel contribution (76003753) the Masters program to which the students belong is Sida-funded and carried out by the Economics Education and Research Consortium (EERC) in Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
